WEBVTT

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:40.480
Long ago, a traveler who was lost in the mist came upon a castle.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:48.000
Hoping to stay there overnight, the traveler went to visit the castle.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:51.500
But, no one was there.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:57.720
While the traveler was looking around, he noticed an inner garden,

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:00.210
but there was no way to get to it.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:05.670
Meanwhile, he found a room with a lot of treasures.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.940
Wondering whether there were more to be found,
the traveler went searching,

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:13.230
and found a shocking room.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:20.190
There were many women who had been skewered.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:27.690
The traveler became scared and ran for his life.

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:31.580
When the traveler finally got home,

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.830
he could not forget the mountains of treasures.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:40.470
The traveler went out looking for that castle again,

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:45.500
but he was never able to find it.

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:13.190
Owww...

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.390
This...

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:32.660
That time, Apos took the Fruit of Time from me.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.940
How many years have passed since then?

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.350
What are you trying to do, Apos?

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.970
Wh-What is this?

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:31.610
What?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.110
Kill me... more.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.330
Kill me... Kill me...

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:20.640
A-Angel?

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.870
That's impossible...

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.310
N-No...

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.040
Stop it.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:45.350
Welcome, Rin...

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:47.850
to my castle.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.370
Mimi! Are you okay?

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.740
Welcome back.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:06.580
Mimi?

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:12.590
She's been like this ever since we got here.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.390
What happened?

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.090
When I went to look, no one was there.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:21.720
Only signs that there had been a battle.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:25.460
And she was there, at the back of the property.

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:29.310
And also...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.560
That's...

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.490
It seemed pretty important, so I brought it back.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.510
I saw something similar to that when I was a child.

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:40.610
That's the Fruit of Time from an angel.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:44.860
It must've been in your house when you were little.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.490
How do you know that?

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.970
No, Mimi. Where is Rin-san?

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.600
She's still alive of course.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:55.130
That's why I'm searching for Apos' castle like this.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:19.960
Don't look at me like that.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.740
This is his hobby.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:24.200
The wedding dress too.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.750
Maybe it's because you were close to Yggdrasill's root?

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.620
Even when you end up reduced to a Fruit of Time,
you revive immediately.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:39.010
How miserable you are.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.850
According to him, some preparations still need to be made.

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:47.600
Until your groom arrives, you'll have to endure that.

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:19.890
Why are you so desperate, Holmes?

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.260
When I first met Rin...

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.310
an angel was in the process of eating me.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:40.620
Since then, she's been protecting me all the time.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:44.560
Of course, I helped her out a bit too.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.030
But I was only helping her.

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:49.530
That's why I'm going to protect her this time...

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.290
from Apos' hands.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.290
It can't be...

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:21.630
Tamaki.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.320
No way.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:25.630
Back then, you were...

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:30.590
Thank you...

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:34.800
for releasing me from this pain.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:37.850
Ihika. Ih—

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:59.110
I wonder if she noticed my present.

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:01.190
Now then.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:02.140
Shall we go?

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:09.710
Hey, do you know what a "sacrificial pawn" is?

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:22.760
Iwan. Aren't you on the late shift tonight?

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:25.880
She's here.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.440
Hey, what's wrong?

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:57.560
Tolstoy is impressive.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:02.100
His work makes Iwan's foolishness seem beautiful because it's honest.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.110
Will the microwave industry hold up?

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:12.120
Yes. It's only down a bit, but it's improving—

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:14.180
What's wrong?

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:21.970
Chief, there's been an explosion at the Litakiria nuclear reactor.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.250
What did you say?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.180
Prices in China and the central areas have started dropping rapidly.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:29.630
This is affecting all markets.

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.520
Seal off the information immediately.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.470
Yes, sir.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.010
What is this?

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.180
An explosion, is it?

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:44.770
Did you find anything about the castle?

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:47.080
Only fragments.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:50.290
Vampire?

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.430
Home of the vampires.

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:55.560
In central Europe, there are legends of a castle in the mist.

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:58.280
A castle in the mist? Sounds romantic.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:02.150
After you hear the story, it won't seem romantic or anything.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.290
It's a cruel story.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.500
Is that Apos' castle, Holmes?

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.970
I can't confirm it.

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.840
I don't have any other leads.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:12.500
Where are you going?

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.260
Around.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.650
Why Acapulco?

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.820
Weren't you going to search for the path to the castle?

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.650
I'm meeting some acquaintances.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.870
Although it's the first time she's met me.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:35.040
Grasshopper.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:43.420
Is that all you ever drink?

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.420
It's kind of like my trademark.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.530
The information?

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.330
You're so impatient.

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:14.650
Just because we slept together, you think we're lovers?

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.960
I'm in a hurry here.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.460
You won't get any information if you kill me.

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:27.410
Is this information accurate?

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:31.140
The extraordinary price is for that.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.360
What information did you get?

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.120
Some rare information regarding central Europe.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:46.820
Satellite information is not directly available to the public.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.640
Most of it is hidden behind walls of military secrecy.

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:50.810
Is that right?

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:54.330
If we took more time,
we'd be able to get information from the military too,

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.870
but we're in a hurry now.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.000
No way!

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.260
An immortal.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:18.170
Who are you?

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.920
Is that you on the phone?

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.430
I have something to talk about concerning Rin and Apos.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:27.940
I understand.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.840
Now will you finally believe...

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:37.950
that immortals really exist?

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:42.700
It would be futile, even if you attacked with missiles.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.030
You saw it, right?

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:46.450
They can even survive a reactor explosion.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:50.380
There are lots of people like that on the other side.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.220
What can I do to win?

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:55.680
The thinking of large nations is so simple.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.990
You only think about winning or losing.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.830
If you want to win...

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.690
this is the only thing you need.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.190
Eh?

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:27.200
Why is the castle wall always outside the window?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:32.790
All the windows face outwards.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.340
What's... on the inside?

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:41.710
Is Apos inside—

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:54.480
Ihika...

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.480
Stop it!

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:01.480
Is this...

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:05.320
the Fruit of Time you got from that man?

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:05.990
Give it back!

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:09.020
The Fruits from angels are different than yours.

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:10.950
They can't be revived, can they?

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.490
Something like this has no meaning.

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:14.660
No!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.800
Your eyes.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:27.600
It makes me shiver when I look at your eyes.

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:30.820
To be able to kill you like that.

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:37.470
You can't run away!

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:46.110
It seems like we're getting farther and farther away from central Europe.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:54.090
Why?

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.860
That's Yggdrasill?

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:56.790
You can see it?

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.620
Yeah. It's that thing floating in the sky, right?

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:03.690
Yggdrasill appears in the sight of those who are going to die.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:04.630
Fruits of Time!

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:07.740
Over there!

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:10.420
That's what the rumor was.

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:12.850
The rumor that's been going around?

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:15.450
The rumor that was circulated in anticipation of this day.

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:16.990
Let's hurry...

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.750
before the world goes to hell!

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:23.550
What's wrong?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.610
Th-They're coming.

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.460
With this, I won't die anymore?

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.480
Really?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:38.970
What's happening?

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.460
My body...

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:49.100
Take me away from here.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.070
Right.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.330
It looks like a European castle.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.650
The Crusaders came through here too.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:21.580
Why are all the faces gone?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:27.150
Up to this point,
even local people can enter if they have the courage.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.090
But beyond here...

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:32.340
no one can enter.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:38.220
Who is that person?

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:41.330
Mimi?

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:44.030
You go talk to him.

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.230
But—

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:57.820
Quite a gloomy face.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:58.790
You are...

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:00.600
I see.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:03.040
Tajima, Kuki, or Maeno?

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.420
Maeno... Mishio.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:06.040
Who are you?

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.510
I am the Guardian of Yggdrasill.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:10.760
Or I used to be.

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:11.850
Used to be?

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:15.470
Apos is the Guardian of Yggdrasill now.

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:16.480
What is this Guardian?

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:20.070
The Guardian protects Yggdrasill.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:22.930
Eventually he becomes connected to the god's bride through blood,

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:26.560
and must yield his position to the new Guardian.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:28.990
I don't really understand.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.070
You don't have to understand.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:34.260
What's important is that Apos is trying to change that.

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:36.570
He's trying to become an eternal Guardian.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:38.590
Eternal Guardian?

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:39.960
That's right.

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:45.300
To achieve that, he's going to give the bride's Fruit of Time to Yggdrasill.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.430
Is that Rin-san?

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:51.590
She was chosen to be the god's bride.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:55.090
To be... Apos' bride?

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.740
You shouldn't get closer than that.

00:20:57.740 --> 00:20:58.880
I know.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:04.160
Moreover, he revealed the secret of the immortals to normal people.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.370
He's trying to change the world this way.

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:11.460
What... should we do...

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.570
to save Rin?

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.390
I will open a corridor for you...

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:18.990
to prevent that from happening.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:41.130
Hurry.

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:48.020
Go.

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:49.200
Yes.

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:53.940
Sorry.

00:21:58.070 --> 00:22:00.850
This world is on land, but it's not in our world.

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:03.500
It's pretty impressive.

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:06.500
I feel the presence of angels there.

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.220
Are you okay?

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:09.750
I'll manage.

00:22:09.750 --> 00:22:13.290
Say, with your condition, what will you do if you meet Apos?

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:16.310
I don't know if it will work or not,

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.520
but I've made preparations.

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:22.180
All the pieces will soon be gathered.

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:26.140
I don't want to be interrupted, Laura.

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:28.540
It's your fault.

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:03.800
Geez, you're so persistent.

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:07.330
But it's about time we settle this,

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:09.150
no matter what Apos says.

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:12.140
I'm going to take the Fruit of Time from you,

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:14.010
and give it to the angels as their food.

00:23:15.640 --> 00:23:17.160
Miserable creatures.

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:20.630
They've already responded to your scent.

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:25.090
Just wait. I'll take out her Fruit and feed it to you guys now.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:29.080
F-Fools, it's not me!

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:29.590
You guys...

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:35.000
Don't tell me, this is what Apos wants?

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:35.390
Damn it!

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:37.680
Let go!

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:38.130
You!

00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:43.090
You!

00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:50.510
Eat me.

00:23:50.510 --> 00:23:52.650
You were immortal too.

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:14.630
It's pretty messed up.

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:17.560
Be careful.

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:18.520
Angels are...

00:24:28.140 --> 00:24:29.220
This way!

00:24:29.610 --> 00:24:30.570
Come.

00:24:37.530 --> 00:24:38.980
What should I do?

00:24:38.980 --> 00:24:39.580
Hey.

00:24:45.090 --> 00:24:46.500
Eat me.

00:24:56.580 --> 00:24:57.780
That was scary.

00:25:01.460 --> 00:25:02.640
Thank you.

00:25:03.180 --> 00:25:04.730
I was saved.

00:25:05.270 --> 00:25:07.890
Thanks to that person.

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:10.120
You are...

00:25:10.120 --> 00:25:12.850
I will lead you to where Rin is.

00:25:14.540 --> 00:25:15.850
What are you planning?

00:25:16.730 --> 00:25:20.360
The contract from my employer expired.

00:25:23.280 --> 00:25:24.330
I understand.

00:25:25.620 --> 00:25:27.070
Thank you.

00:25:47.980 --> 00:25:49.080
This is...

00:25:49.680 --> 00:25:51.300
The Root of Yggdrasill.

00:25:56.250 --> 00:25:59.730
The immortal women whose hearts have withered

00:25:59.730 --> 00:26:04.250
come to throw themselves into Yggdrasill's attachment to this world.

00:26:07.260 --> 00:26:10.230
The Guardian mates with one of them,

00:26:10.230 --> 00:26:12.520
and tries to give birth to the next Guardian.

00:26:16.460 --> 00:26:20.050
To have reached this age and still be mating like a young angel...

00:26:23.470 --> 00:26:24.100
Rin.

00:26:24.100 --> 00:26:25.930
No. You must embrace me now.

00:26:26.690 --> 00:26:29.930
For a thousand years, how much I've yearned for you!

00:26:31.800 --> 00:26:32.860
Me too.

00:26:42.180 --> 00:26:42.740
What—

00:26:50.040 --> 00:26:51.000
No.

00:26:54.940 --> 00:26:56.060
Why?

00:26:56.610 --> 00:26:57.740
Why won't I die?

00:26:57.740 --> 00:26:59.170
It's your fate.

00:26:59.170 --> 00:26:59.620
Don't look.

00:27:00.990 --> 00:27:03.050
If you look, I must mate with you!

00:27:06.880 --> 00:27:08.460
What if I say that's all right?

00:27:09.780 --> 00:27:10.970
I must eat you!

00:27:12.340 --> 00:27:13.970
What if I say that's all right?

00:27:19.370 --> 00:27:20.980
It's cold...

00:27:22.550 --> 00:27:24.350
Warm me up!

00:27:31.230 --> 00:27:32.570
Embrace me.

00:27:35.130 --> 00:27:39.420
When the devil taught me, I learned for the first time.

00:27:41.900 --> 00:27:45.600
I couldn't read the first letter you sent me.

00:27:51.140 --> 00:27:54.560
Your first phone call made me happy.

00:27:58.590 --> 00:28:01.020
Reading and writing, Yggdrasill.

00:28:01.690 --> 00:28:05.430
You taught me many things.

00:28:11.900 --> 00:28:13.780
I've been dreaming...

00:28:14.420 --> 00:28:16.120
of you embracing me...

00:28:17.230 --> 00:28:19.790
I was always yours.

00:28:21.020 --> 00:28:22.360
Ever since then.

00:29:11.080 --> 00:29:12.890
A-Apos?

00:29:14.970 --> 00:29:17.480
The Seraphim's Egg has matured.

00:29:18.100 --> 00:29:19.980
Everything has come together.

00:29:19.980 --> 00:29:22.030
I won't let that happen.

00:29:22.960 --> 00:29:25.270
Rin is already...

00:29:26.370 --> 00:29:27.740
no longer yours.

00:29:28.110 --> 00:29:28.850
So?

00:29:30.050 --> 00:29:34.390
Your thinking only goes that far, father.

00:29:34.390 --> 00:29:35.250
No!

00:29:35.580 --> 00:29:36.550
No!

00:29:36.550 --> 00:29:37.280
Rin.

00:29:38.160 --> 00:29:42.160
Take my... Fruit of Time.

00:29:51.210 --> 00:29:52.260
Wait.

00:29:55.720 --> 00:29:57.290
That's too bad.

00:29:57.290 --> 00:29:59.810
You couldn't take his white blood.

00:30:00.660 --> 00:30:01.720
Apos.

00:30:04.850 --> 00:30:05.860
You...

00:30:05.860 --> 00:30:07.350
How dare you...

00:30:07.980 --> 00:30:10.040
It must have been painful.

00:30:10.040 --> 00:30:13.270
I wanted to kill more of your lovers with these hands.

00:30:13.270 --> 00:30:16.780
To kill more of those most precious to you before your eyes.

00:30:19.410 --> 00:30:21.300
Do you know what that's for?

00:30:22.680 --> 00:30:26.180
I only want to eat your memories.

00:30:26.800 --> 00:30:27.970
What did you say?

00:30:28.490 --> 00:30:30.930
The more painful your memories, the more delicious they are.

00:30:31.840 --> 00:30:33.580
It's not just that.

00:30:33.580 --> 00:30:37.500
If Yggdrasill accepts you as a bride to the god,

00:30:37.500 --> 00:30:40.940
I wonder what that memory will taste like.

00:30:41.960 --> 00:30:43.770
You probably don't know

00:30:43.770 --> 00:30:45.820
what Yggdrasill is.

00:30:47.190 --> 00:30:50.690
It's an infinite information collector.

00:30:51.290 --> 00:30:55.730
The spores that are released remember everything that they pass through.

00:30:56.370 --> 00:31:00.370
Eventually, the spores that are absorbed in the ground return to Yggdrasill,

00:31:00.700 --> 00:31:03.820
and increase that information repository.

00:31:03.820 --> 00:31:11.160
In other words, the Fruits of Time are nothing more than spies for Yggdrasill.

00:31:13.500 --> 00:31:16.850
And now that you've received the ceremony from my father,

00:31:16.850 --> 00:31:20.470
I'll be able to obtain that memory after you go in there.

00:31:24.140 --> 00:31:27.150
My body... if you eat it...

00:31:28.350 --> 00:31:29.430
what will you do with it?

00:31:29.430 --> 00:31:32.120
I've made preparations for that too.

00:31:32.120 --> 00:31:34.850
Wars will start around the world now.

00:31:34.850 --> 00:31:38.540
Incidents like that nuclear reactor explosion will occur one after another.

00:31:38.950 --> 00:31:42.540
Everyone will come to want the Fruits of Time.

00:31:42.540 --> 00:31:43.910
And then...

00:31:43.910 --> 00:31:48.090
when all the spores come back, I'll spread them even more!

00:31:50.460 --> 00:31:51.790
That should be enough, right?

00:31:51.790 --> 00:31:54.470
Now, the Egg is waiting for you.

00:31:58.100 --> 00:31:59.090
Rin!

00:32:02.570 --> 00:32:03.480
Apos.

00:32:24.180 --> 00:32:25.150
Rin!

00:32:26.880 --> 00:32:27.570
Mimi.

00:32:27.570 --> 00:32:28.570
I'm going to take it out.

00:32:33.840 --> 00:32:34.650
Rin.

00:32:37.860 --> 00:32:39.440
Thank you.

00:32:39.440 --> 00:32:41.160
Sorry for making you go through so much.

00:32:41.160 --> 00:32:42.400
Don't worry about that...

00:32:44.680 --> 00:32:46.360
Hey, what did you do?

00:32:48.580 --> 00:32:51.220
I hacked the microwave satellite a bit.

00:32:51.780 --> 00:32:53.870
My father's company's?

00:32:53.870 --> 00:32:54.280
Yeah.

00:32:54.700 --> 00:32:56.680
But how did you get the location of this castle?

00:32:56.680 --> 00:32:59.330
I see. You got it from the informant.

00:32:59.330 --> 00:33:00.310
That's right.

00:33:00.310 --> 00:33:02.920
I knew the rough location from that.

00:33:02.920 --> 00:33:04.710
You really are foolish.

00:33:10.340 --> 00:33:14.040
You wouldn't die, even in a nuclear reactor explosion.

00:33:14.410 --> 00:33:18.920
Did you think that something made from material like that would succumb to your attack?

00:33:24.270 --> 00:33:25.200
Rin...

00:33:25.810 --> 00:33:26.880
What should I do?

00:33:26.880 --> 00:33:28.260
Save Rin.

00:33:31.370 --> 00:33:33.600
Now... go.

00:33:34.130 --> 00:33:39.120
You... what do you want to do with this world?

00:33:39.810 --> 00:33:41.330
I want to taste it.

00:33:45.790 --> 00:33:46.520
No!

00:33:48.050 --> 00:33:48.870
Rin-san!

00:33:50.970 --> 00:33:51.830
Rin-san!

00:33:54.940 --> 00:33:56.820
That's beautiful.

00:33:56.820 --> 00:34:00.680
The moment when your desire to save her goes to waste.

00:34:08.270 --> 00:34:09.690
Rin-san!

00:34:10.520 --> 00:34:13.190
And now I can't get out of here!

00:34:13.190 --> 00:34:14.690
What is that?

00:34:17.920 --> 00:34:19.200
We have a different business here.

00:34:20.020 --> 00:34:22.400
Well, it's impressive of you, given your condition.

00:34:24.840 --> 00:34:28.570
Now then, should I use you to kill time again?

00:35:05.220 --> 00:35:06.790
Who am I?

00:35:27.310 --> 00:35:31.190
The physical body is just a cradle for the Fruits of Time.

00:35:32.050 --> 00:35:34.880
Even the brain won't grow forever.

00:35:34.880 --> 00:35:37.730
It only has the feedback from the Fruits of Time.

00:35:38.720 --> 00:35:40.350
So?

00:35:40.350 --> 00:35:41.610
What are you saying?

00:35:42.550 --> 00:35:46.350
That's why you always wanted stimuli.

00:35:46.870 --> 00:35:49.820
Even food and sex, which you don't need in the first place.

00:35:50.550 --> 00:35:52.500
But your mind is weak.

00:35:53.000 --> 00:35:56.490
When you live for a long time, it becomes broken.

00:36:00.280 --> 00:36:03.480
In that respect, Rin is very impressive.

00:36:04.080 --> 00:36:06.850
I wonder what you'll become.

00:36:07.310 --> 00:36:08.590
Don't mess with me.

00:36:09.160 --> 00:36:11.340
Who is going to do it with you?

00:36:11.890 --> 00:36:13.910
Pain and pleasure.

00:36:13.910 --> 00:36:15.130
Which one do you like?

00:36:16.310 --> 00:36:16.960
Rin.

00:36:17.650 --> 00:36:18.610
Please.

00:36:58.490 --> 00:36:59.220
This is...

00:37:33.150 --> 00:37:34.550
Shougo?

00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:36.020
Kouki.

00:37:36.650 --> 00:37:37.910
Don't tell me...

00:37:37.910 --> 00:37:39.090
that fruit is yours?

00:37:41.940 --> 00:37:43.340
I see.

00:37:43.340 --> 00:37:45.690
These are links from Kouki's memories,

00:37:45.690 --> 00:37:49.030
the memories of the Maeno family that are inside Yggdrasill.

00:37:53.550 --> 00:37:55.690
Now I finally know your name.

00:37:56.360 --> 00:38:00.840
And maybe why the Maeno family is always around me.

00:38:02.090 --> 00:38:06.830
You're the one who obtained the Fruit of Time
on the Emperor's order.

00:38:07.790 --> 00:38:10.840
You're Tajimamori?

00:38:37.280 --> 00:38:38.530
Kouki.

00:38:52.550 --> 00:38:53.000
Rin-san!

00:38:57.010 --> 00:38:58.860
Oww...

00:39:00.510 --> 00:39:01.010
Rin-san.

00:39:02.220 --> 00:39:04.640
You're a descendant of Tajimamori.

00:39:05.300 --> 00:39:07.950
Your fate was shaped for this.

00:39:08.990 --> 00:39:11.360
You did something quite unnecessary.

00:39:11.980 --> 00:39:14.610
I can't leave the Seraphim's Egg this way.

00:39:15.560 --> 00:39:17.330
I'll make you go back in again.

00:39:21.010 --> 00:39:22.520
Stand up, Rin.

00:39:25.780 --> 00:39:26.300
Rin-san.

00:39:26.300 --> 00:39:27.530
Now!

00:39:28.040 --> 00:39:29.250
I am...

00:39:30.870 --> 00:39:33.300
the new Guardian of Yggdrasill.

00:39:33.300 --> 00:39:35.420
What are you saying?

00:39:41.590 --> 00:39:42.990
That's cool.

00:39:42.990 --> 00:39:45.050
Rin-san, you're beautiful.

00:39:48.130 --> 00:39:53.310
Now, go taste the memories of Yggdrasill that you so desire.

00:39:56.540 --> 00:39:57.380
Stop it!

00:39:57.380 --> 00:39:58.830
Let go!

00:39:58.830 --> 00:39:59.630
No...

00:40:00.550 --> 00:40:01.540
No!

00:40:02.410 --> 00:40:04.850
You are a man and a woman.

00:40:04.850 --> 00:40:06.800
A woman and a man.

00:40:06.800 --> 00:40:10.690
However, you've only tasted the memories of women.

00:40:10.690 --> 00:40:13.300
What you need are the memories of a man.

00:40:17.070 --> 00:40:19.720
I don't want my father's!

00:40:19.720 --> 00:40:22.850
No, it's your duty as his son...

00:40:22.850 --> 00:40:24.950
to receive your father's memories.

00:40:29.250 --> 00:40:30.200
Dearest...

00:40:36.950 --> 00:40:42.450
With this, you'll be able to taste all of Yggdrasill's memories.

00:40:43.110 --> 00:40:48.620
But you won't have someone like Mimi or Mishio to call you back.

00:40:48.620 --> 00:40:49.560
Rin.

00:40:51.420 --> 00:40:52.380
This person.

00:40:52.380 --> 00:40:55.460
I want to let him know...

00:40:55.460 --> 00:40:56.760
my pain.

00:40:57.520 --> 00:40:59.250
I wanted you to stay alive.

00:40:59.900 --> 00:41:02.900
I would break my body if I had one.

00:41:03.600 --> 00:41:06.510
Do you want me to go on living,
with only my brain and head being immortal?

00:41:08.640 --> 00:41:09.760
I understand.

00:41:10.230 --> 00:41:12.240
I won't thank you.

00:41:16.330 --> 00:41:18.490
Take her with you too.

00:41:42.810 --> 00:41:45.660
Roots for the new Yggdrasill?

00:41:45.660 --> 00:41:47.530
What will happen now?

00:41:47.530 --> 00:41:49.610
I'm pregnant.

00:41:49.610 --> 00:41:50.270
Eh?

00:41:50.940 --> 00:41:53.130
Before you came...

00:41:53.780 --> 00:41:55.780
that person gave this to me.

00:41:57.890 --> 00:41:59.000
Um...

00:41:59.000 --> 00:42:01.850
For the Guardian to give birth to the child of the Guardian...

00:42:01.850 --> 00:42:02.810
That's...

00:42:02.810 --> 00:42:07.050
Having lived a thousand years,
I've experienced just about everything.

00:42:07.050 --> 00:42:10.840
The only thing I haven't experienced is giving birth.

00:42:26.240 --> 00:42:28.340
Northern America is still going through a civil war.

00:42:28.870 --> 00:42:30.940
Other than that, things seem to have calmed down.

00:42:30.940 --> 00:42:32.600
But what about Yggdrasill?

00:42:32.600 --> 00:42:33.820
Everyone saw it, right?

00:42:34.250 --> 00:42:36.320
Will everything go back to how it was?

00:42:37.990 --> 00:42:39.820
Mankind is strong.

00:42:40.390 --> 00:42:42.350
As the world has grown larger,

00:42:42.350 --> 00:42:44.830
they've learned to accept various things.

00:42:44.830 --> 00:42:47.370
That's why they've been able to expand this far.

00:42:48.050 --> 00:42:52.910
Someday, they'll even be able to accept that there are immortals, and Yggdrasill.

00:42:54.400 --> 00:42:55.820
That's how people are.

00:42:58.810 --> 00:43:03.750
By the time you've grown up, what will the world be like?

00:43:04.480 --> 00:43:06.760
In the end, what is this kid?

00:43:07.170 --> 00:43:09.360
The son of that person and me.

00:43:09.890 --> 00:43:10.930
That's good enough, right?

00:43:11.600 --> 00:43:15.330
What does Yggdrasill want Rin to do?

00:43:15.330 --> 00:43:17.940
There's no way for us to know.

00:43:18.750 --> 00:43:20.020
Right, right.

00:43:20.610 --> 00:43:24.440
Lots of things are enjoyable because we don't know.
